### Service Layer & Ingestion

#### [MODIFY] [wireService.ts](file:///d:/Rian/hackathons/build-a-thon/src/services/wireService.ts)
- Implement `orchestrateSearchQuery(query: string, config: LlmConfig)` method:
  1. Call Local AI (`http://localhost:11434/api/generate`) to classify the query category. Fallback to keyword-based classification on failure.
  2. Dynamically construct `action_id` list based on the category (e.g. `google_news.search`, `techcrunch.search`, etc.).
  3. Execute `Promise.all` of `POST` requests to `https://api.anakin.io/v1/wire/task` using the `X-API-Key` header.
  4. Parse response list and map news articles/discussions to `TopicData` structure.
  5. Pass consolidated data back to Local AI to generate the Executive Summary bullet points.
  6. Return the consolidated `TopicData` payload.
- Update `fetchTopicData(query: string, config?: LlmConfig)` to call `orchestrateSearchQuery` when Live AI / Wire API key is configured.

